 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Josiah was young when he became king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He did what was right in the Lord's sight",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In his twelfth year he began to cleanse",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Idols and images cast to the dust",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He tore down the altars of Baal",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And scattered the dust over the graves",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He burned the bones of the priests",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And cleansed Judah and Jerusalem",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He humbled himself before the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Tore his clothes and wept in sorrow",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He heard the words of the Law",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And sought the God of Israel",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hilkiah found the Book of the Law",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hidden in the house of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shaphan brought it to the king",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And read the words in his presence",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the king heard the Law's command",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He tore his clothes in great distress",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sent messengers to Huldah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
